able & implant prosthetics","🔍 Multi-surface caries & fillings (ICDAS / CARS severity, root & radiographic caries), endo & AAE pulp diagnosis, apical diagnosis, peri-implant status, wear, discoloration, orthodontics","🩺 Full periodontal module (see above) + 2017 classification","🔗 HL7 FHIR R4 export/import; JSON export/import with migrations","🧬 Standards-based diagnosis coding — WHO ICD-10 always on, per-tooth & case/regional diagnoses, selectable national packs (BNO-10, US ICD-10-CM), an opt-in SNOMED CT overlay, and full FHIR Condition export/import…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZoliQua/React-Advanced-Odontogram/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c9fd5761523350b717fb821cbec6483e7fa3d67f4fba709ba9f127fc3c7dbbff","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.139Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.139Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"📖 Full documentation is available per language:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZoliQua/React-Advanced-Odontogram/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c9fd5761523350b717fb821cbec6483e7fa3d67f4fba709ba9f127fc3c7dbbff","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZoliQua/React-Advanced-Odontogram/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.140Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-14T19:08:35Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZoliQua/React-Advanced-Odontogram/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.140Z","hash":"c9fd5761523350b717fb821cbec6483e7fa3d67f4fba709ba9f127fc3c7dbbff","originalBytes":10070,"storedBytes":10070,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.015Z","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Data & dashboards","source":"metadata","match":"charting"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Autom